    "doc-db update via desired-state sync with --start/--status polling by SKILL",
    "doc-link query-docs, embed-dlid, index-docs flow; freshness check left to doc-link",
    "Query-to-update delegation with explicit backend specification",
    "Use case sequences, error handling table, user notifications",
    "Existing components reused, unit/wrapper/integration/contract test design",
    "Completeness check against REQ-014 and doc-db MCP contract snapshot"
  ],
